'''Spacefish Jones''' (スペースマンボルグ, ''Supēsumanborugu'', '''Space Manborg''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Sunfish Jones]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

